        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the third new moon after the people of Israel had gone forth out of the land of Egypt, on that day they came into the wilderness of Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when they set out from Rephidim and came into the wilderness of Sinai, they encamped in the wilderness; and there Israel encamped before the mountain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses went up to God, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " called to him out of the mountain, saying, “Thus you shall say to the house of Jacob, and tell the people of Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have seen what I did to the Egyptians, and how I bore you on eagles' wings and brought you to myself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
